    <string name="help_title">Help</string>
    <string name="help_body">Getting started\n1. Log in with your board number and password.\n2. Open Set up Wi‑Fi and connect to the board over Bluetooth.\n3. Add short words (max 8 letters) in Word library.\n4. On the board, use Refresh when online to sync words.\n\nTips\n• Words must be lowercase English letters only.\n• Delete a word only after confirming the dialog.\n• If login fails, check that the board exists in Firebase.\n• Log out from Board settings when switching boards.\n\nHardware\n• Status LED on the Pi shows internet connectivity.\n• Buttons on the board navigate letters and words.</string>

